# ── NOTE (s01-8b4389) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rules for .soma/, cycles/, consumers/ and log.md were REMOVED, not relaxed.
# The repo root moved down one level: those directories now live in the PARENT
# (tincture-css/), physically outside this repo. The separation is structural
# rather than rule-based, so an ignore entry protecting them would be a rule
# guarding something git can no longer see -- and a rule that cannot fire reads
# as protection that isn't there.
